<title>UK: June Labuan sets $105 mln five-year secured FRN.</title>
<headline>June Labuan sets $105 mln five-year secured FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Nomura (Singapore) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JUNE LABUAN LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $105 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +90 BP    PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.625</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED BY FIRST FIXED CHARGE OVER CAMERLIN GROUP</p>
<p>BERHAD</p>
<p>		$150 MILLION SECURED FRN DUE 2002</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/HK/SI/MY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
